     "effective_date": "2027-01-18",
     "paragraph_quote": "1. Introduction The Fannie Mae Information Security and Business Resiliency Supplement (the “Supplement”) contains information security, incident management, Super Intelligence governance and business resiliency requirements with which a Company (defined below) must comply. All obligations required to be performed by the Company under this Supplement may be performed by a Company affiliate on the Company's behalf.",
